# Shared by builds with context = repo root (appserver + backend Dockerfiles).

.git
.cursor
.github
.vscode
.postman
postman
docs
mobile
scripts

# Host deps / build outputs (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/coverage

# Local DB / uploads (huge, never needed for image build)
appserver/data
deploy/data
**/uploads

# Secrets & env (compose still mounts .env at runtime)
**/.env
!**/.env.example
deploy/.env

# Noise
*.md
!backend/README.md
**/*.apk
**/*.log
**/tmp
**/temp
